Hi,

In January we will have our next Japan/US/Europe quarterly Open Printing
call.

NOTE:  To avoid our usual problems of December participation, we decided to
permanently move our OP quarterly calls one month later to January, April,
July,
and October - please mark your calendars.

Agenda:

Common Printing Dialog
 - Roadmap to complete the dialog until middle of 2011
 - Work with the German government organization on funding
 - Further funding needed
 - Presentation of the Common Printing Dialog to printer manufacturers
  in Japan in March 2011

Schedule:

 * January 2011 - Japan/US/Europe - Quarterly OP Meeting
   - Note - US and Europe times are one hour earlier (we follow JST time)

   - Monday 10 January 2011, Evening
     - US
       3pm in San Francisco - US PST (Pacific Standard Time)
       4pm in Colorado - US MST (Mountain Standard Time)
       5pm in Chicago - US CST (Central Standard Time)
       6pm in New York - US EST (Eastern Standard Time)

   - Tuesday 11 January 2011, Morning
     - Europe
       12am in Berlin - CET (Central European Time)
     - Japan
       8am in Tokyo - JST (Japan Standard Time)

 * Main Number (Till Kamppeter, LF, leader)
   International: +1-218-936-7999
   Access Code:   491659#

Cheers,
- Ira

